{% liquid
  assign founder_image_url = 'prime-founder.png' | asset_url
  assign hero_image_url = 'prime-about-himalayas-yak-hero.png' | asset_url
%}

<section class="prime-founder-about" aria-labelledby="PrimeFounderAboutTitle">
  <div class="pfa-hero">
    <div class="pfa-hero__media">
      <img
        src="{{ hero_image_url }}"
        alt="Yaks grazing in the Himalayan foothills, reflecting Prime Pet Food's Nepalese yak chew roots"
        width="1672"
        height="941"
        loading="eager"
        class="pfa-hero__image"
      >
    </div>

    <div class="pfa-hero__overlay"></div>

    <div class="pfa-shell pfa-hero__content">
      <p class="pfa-kicker">Our story</p>
      <h1 id="PrimeFounderAboutTitle">From the foothills of Nepal to your living room floor.</h1>
      <p>
        I grew up around chhurpi, the hard cheese tradition of Nepal's mountain communities.
        Prime Pet Food carries that memory into a chew made with 4 simple ingredients: Yak milk, cow milk, lime juice, salt.
      </p>
      <div class="pfa-hero__actions" aria-label="About page actions">
        <a href="/collections/all" class="pfa-button pfa-button--primary">Shop yak chews</a>
        <a href="#founder-story" class="pfa-button pfa-button--secondary">Read the story</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pfa-origin" id="founder-story">
    <div class="pfa-shell pfa-origin__grid">
      <div class="pfa-origin__intro">
        <p class="pfa-kicker">Dipak's story</p>
        <h2>I didn't start a pet brand. I brought my family's tradition to dogs who deserve better.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="pfa-story">
        <p>
          I grew up in Nepal, where chhurpi, a traditional hard cheese, was part of everyday
          mountain life. Milk, heat, lime, salt, pressure, and weeks of patience. It was not exotic
          or trendy. It was simply food made honestly.
        </p>
        <p>
          When I moved to the United States in 2019 and got my first dog, I saw how confusing the
          chew aisle could be. So many products felt processed, short lived, or hard to understand.
          I kept thinking about the hard cheese tradition I knew from Nepal: simple, durable, and
          made with patience instead of shortcuts.
        </p>
        <p>
          So I did what felt obvious — I brought the tradition I grew up with to dogs who deserve
          something real. Prime Pet Food is that tradition: 4 simple ingredients, crafted in Nepal
          using traditional Himalayan methods, packed in the USA under Prime Pet Food quality
          standards. Nothing added for show, nothing hidden, nothing vague.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pfa-editorial">
    <div class="pfa-shell pfa-editorial__grid">
      <div class="pfa-founder-card">
        <img
          src="{{ founder_image_url }}"
          alt="Dipak Regmi, founder of Prime Pet Food"
          width="941"
          height="1672"
          loading="lazy"
          class="pfa-founder-card__image"
        >
        <div class="pfa-founder-card__caption">
            <strong>Dipak Regmi</strong>
            <span>Founder, Prime Pet Food</span>
            <em class="pfa-founder-card__signature" aria-label="Signed by Dipak Regmi">Dipak</em>
          </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pfa-editorial__copy">
        <p class="pfa-kicker">Why this matters</p>
        <h2>Your dog deserves a chew you actually feel good about.</h2>
        <p>
          A great chew isn't just a distraction — it's your dog's favorite part of the day. It's the
          moment they settle in, stop pacing, and find that deep, satisfied focus. That's what we
          built Prime Pet Food around.
        </p>
        <p>
          4 simple ingredients: Yak milk, cow milk, lime juice, salt. Crafted in Nepal using
          traditional Himalayan methods. Packed in the USA under Prime Pet Food quality standards.
          When you choose Prime Pet Food, you are choosing a chew with a real origin story behind it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pfa-milestones">
    <div class="pfa-shell">
      <div class="pfa-section-head">
        <p class="pfa-kicker">Our journey</p>
        <h2>From a kitchen table idea to 20,000+ happy dogs.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="pfa-milestones__grid" aria-label="Prime Pet Food milestones">
        <article>
          <span>2019</span>
          <h3>The idea takes shape</h3>
          <p>I moved to the US, got my first dog, and remembered the hard cheese tradition I grew up around in Nepal. That memory became the start of Prime Pet Food.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>2024</span>
          <h3>First families trust us</h3>
          <p>Word spread. Dog parents started telling friends about the chew their power chewer couldn't destroy in five minutes. We hit our first 2,400 five-star reviews.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>2026</span>
          <h3>20,000+ dogs and growing</h3>
          <p>Today we serve families across the US with yak cheese chews crafted in Nepal using traditional Himalayan methods and sized for real dogs at home.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pfa-team">
    <div class="pfa-shell pfa-team__inner">
      <div>
        <p class="pfa-kicker">Our team</p>
        <h2>Small team. Big standards. Every email gets a real answer.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="pfa-team__copy">
        <p>
          We're a small, focused crew — sourcing, fulfillment, customer support, and product.
          That means when you message us about sizing for your 80lb Lab, a real person answers
          (usually within 4 hours). We care because we're dog people too.
        </p>
        <div class="pfa-team__stats" aria-label="Prime Pet Food team trust stats">
          <span>20,000+ dog parents trust us</span>
          <span>4.9★ across 2,400+ reviews</span>
          <span>30-day tail-wag guarantee</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pfa-beliefs">
    <div class="pfa-shell">
      <div class="pfa-section-head">
        <p class="pfa-kicker">What we believe</p>
        <h2>If we wouldn't give it to our own dogs, we won't sell it to yours.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="pfa-beliefs__grid">
        <article class="pfa-belief">
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Heritage you can taste</h3>
          <p>
            Our chews are crafted in Nepal using traditional Himalayan methods and 4 simple
            ingredients: Yak milk, cow milk, lime juice, salt. No fillers, no mystery powders.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="pfa-belief">
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Built to last</h3>
          <p>
            The average dog chews for 67 minutes. That's over an hour of happy, focused calm —
            not five minutes of shredding followed by begging for more.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="pfa-belief">
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Ingredients that earn their place</h3>
          <p>
            4 ingredients. Rawhide-free. Grain-free. Gluten-free. We believe every single thing
            in a chew should have a reason to be there.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pfa-promise">
    <div class="pfa-shell pfa-promise__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="pfa-kicker">Our promise to you</p>
        <h2>Honest ingredients. Real heritage. A chew you can trust completely.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="pfa-promise__list" aria-label="Prime Pet Food promises">
        <div>
          <strong>The 30-day tail-wag guarantee</strong>
          <span>If your dog doesn't love it, we'll make it right. No questions, no hassle, no fine print.</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>What you see is what you get</strong>
          <span>4 ingredients listed on every page, every label, every time. We don't hide behind vague "natural flavors."</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Supporting the communities behind the craft</strong>
          <span>Each purchase helps keep our sourcing tied to Nepali Himalayan farming families and supports Prime Pet Food's rural education commitment.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pfa-testimonials">
    <div class="pfa-shell">
      <div class="pfa-section-head">
        <p class="pfa-kicker">What dog parents say</p>
        <h2>Real calm-time wins from homes like yours.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="pfa-testimonials__grid">
        <article>
          <div aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
          <p>"Our golden settles with this chew instead of pacing during calls. It feels like a routine now, not a bribe."</p>
          <span>Golden Retriever parent</span>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
          <p>"I wanted something rawhide-free that did not smell up the house. Prime Pet Food became our evening calm-time chew."</p>
          <span>Beagle parent</span>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
          <p>"The size guidance helped us stop guessing. Our power chewer finally has something that lasts long enough."</p>
          <span>German Shepherd parent</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pfa-cta">
    <div class="pfa-shell pfa-cta__inner">
      <p class="pfa-kicker">Ready to try it?</p>
      <h2>Give your dog their new favorite hour of the day.</h2>
      <p>
        Himalayan yak cheese chews crafted in Nepal from 4 simple ingredients.
        Find the right size for your dog and see why 20,000+ families made the switch.
      </p>
      <div class="pfa-cta__actions">
        <a href="/collections/all" class="pfa-button pfa-button--primary">Shop Yak Chews</a>
        <a href="/pages/how-long-will-this-last-for-my-dog" class="pfa-button pfa-button--outline">Find your dog's size</a>
        <a href="/pages/subscribe-and-save" class="pfa-button pfa-button--outline">Never run out</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .prime-founder-about {
    --pfa-ink: #171512;
    --pfa-muted: #5f574e;
    --pfa-soft: #f8f1e7;
    --pfa-cream: #fffaf2;
    --pfa-clay: #b85f32;
    --pfa-clay-dark: #94451f;
    --pfa-forest: #243c2d;
    --pfa-line: rgba(51, 40, 29, 0.14);
    --pfa-card: #ffffff;
    color: var(--pfa-ink);
    background: var(--pfa-cream);
    font-family: var(--prime-font-sans, "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
  }

  .prime-founder-about * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .pfa-shell {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 32px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .pfa-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--pfa-clay);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 780;
  }

  .prime-founder-about h1,
  .prime-founder-about h2,
  .prime-founder-about h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--prime-font-display, var(--prime-font-sans, inherit));
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .prime-founder-about h1 {
    max-width: 820px;
    font-size: 88px;
    line-height: 0.98;
    font-weight: 760;
  }

  .prime-founder-about h2 {
    font-size: 58px;
    line-height: 1.04;
    font-weight: 735;
  }

  .prime-founder-about h3 {
    font-size: 25px;
    line-height: 1.16;
    font-weight: 735;
  }

  .prime-founder-about p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--pfa-muted);
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .pfa-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: clamp(680px, 92vh, 900px);
    display: grid;
    align-items: end;
    overflow: hidden;
    isolation: isolate;
    background: #1e1a15;
  }

  .pfa-hero__media,
  .pfa-hero__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -2;
  }

  .pfa-hero__media::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(19, 16, 12, 0.88) 0%, rgba(19, 16, 12, 0.58) 42%, rgba(19, 16, 12, 0.08) 100%);
  }

  .pfa-hero__image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 64% 34%;
  }

  .pfa-hero__overlay {
    z-index: -1;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 100%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 18% 28%, rgba(184, 95, 50, 0.28), transparent 32%);
  }

  .pfa-hero__content {
    padding-block: clamp(92px, 14vh, 156px) clamp(72px, 10vh, 120px);
  }

  .pfa-hero .pfa-kicker,
  .pfa-hero h1,
  .pfa-hero p {
    color: #fffaf2;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26);
  }

  .pfa-hero p {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    color: rgba(255, 250, 242, 0.86);
  }

  .pfa-hero__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 34px;
  }

  .pfa-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 52px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 15px 26px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 780;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 180ms ease, background 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;
  }

  .pfa-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .pfa-button--primary {
    background: var(--pfa-clay);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgba(77, 36, 16, 0.26);
  }

  .pfa-button--primary:hover {
    background: var(--pfa-clay-dark);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .pfa-button--secondary {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 250, 242, 0.42);
    color: #fffaf2;
    background: rgba(255, 250, 242, 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .pfa-button--outline {
    border: 1px solid rgba(55, 43, 31, 0.18);
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--pfa-ink);
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .pfa-button--outline:hover {
    border-color: rgba(184, 95, 50, 0.42);
    color: var(--pfa-clay-dark);
  }

  .pfa-origin,
  .pfa-editorial,
  .pfa-milestones,
  .pfa-team,
  .pfa-beliefs,
  .pfa-promise,
  .pfa-testimonials,
  .pfa-cta {
    padding-block: clamp(72px, 10vw, 132px);
  }

  .pfa-origin {
    background: var(--pfa-cream);
  }

  .pfa-origin__grid,
  .pfa-editorial__grid,
  .pfa-promise__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: clamp(36px, 6vw, 86px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .pfa-origin__intro {
    position: sticky;
    top: 120px;
  }

  .pfa-story {
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .pfa-story p {
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.62;
    color: #3d352e;
  }

  .pfa-editorial {
    background: var(--pfa-soft);
  }

  .pfa-milestones {
    background: var(--pfa-cream);
  }

  .pfa-milestones__grid,
  .pfa-testimonials__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .pfa-milestones__grid article,
  .pfa-testimonials__grid article {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
    border: 1px solid var(--pfa-line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .pfa-milestones__grid article > span,
  .pfa-testimonials__grid article > div {
    color: var(--pfa-clay);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 820;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .pfa-milestones__grid p,
  .pfa-testimonials__grid p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }

  .pfa-testimonials__grid article > span {
    color: #3d352e;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 780;
  }

  .pfa-team {
    background: var(--pfa-soft);
  }

  .pfa-team__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: clamp(34px, 6vw, 80px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .pfa-team__copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .pfa-team__copy p {
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #3d352e;
  }

  .pfa-team__stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .pfa-team__stats span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 40px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(36, 60, 45, 0.16);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #fffaf2;
    color: var(--pfa-forest);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 10px 14px;
  }

  .pfa-founder-card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 620px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #e8dfd3;
    box-shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(52, 42, 32, 0.12);
  }

  .pfa-founder-card__image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 620px;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 22%;
  }

  .pfa-founder-card__caption {
    position: absolute;
    right: 18px;
    bottom: 18px;
    left: 18px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 18px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.26);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(24, 21, 17, 0.64);
    color: #fffaf2;
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  }

  .pfa-founder-card__caption strong {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .pfa-founder-card__caption span {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: rgba(255, 250, 242, 0.78);
  }

  .pfa-founder-card__signature {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: #f0c18a;
    font-family: "Brush Script MT", "Segoe Script", cursive;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
    font-style: normal;
    line-height: 0.95;
  }

  .pfa-editorial__copy {
    align-self: center;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .pfa-editorial__copy p {
    margin-top: 22px;
  }

  .pfa-beliefs {
    background: #fbf7ef;
  }

  .pfa-section-head {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin-bottom: clamp(34px, 5vw, 56px);
  }

  .pfa-beliefs__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .pfa-belief {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
    min-height: 330px;
    align-content: start;
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px);
    border: 1px solid var(--pfa-line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--pfa-card);
  }

  .pfa-belief span {
    color: var(--pfa-clay);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 820;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .pfa-belief p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }

  .pfa-promise {
    color: #fffaf2;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(184, 95, 50, 0.26), transparent 34%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, #1f3427 0%, #17241d 100%);
  }

  .pfa-promise .pfa-kicker,
  .pfa-promise h2 {
    color: #fffaf2;
  }

  .pfa-promise__list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .pfa-promise__list div {
    padding: 22px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 250, 242, 0.14);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 250, 242, 0.07);
  }

  .pfa-promise__list strong,
  .pfa-promise__list span {
    display: block;
  }

  .pfa-promise__list strong {
    color: #fffaf2;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.24;
    font-weight: 760;
  }

  .pfa-promise__list span {
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: rgba(255, 250, 242, 0.74);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.58;
  }

  .pfa-cta {
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--pfa-cream);
  }

  .pfa-cta__inner {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .pfa-cta p:not(.pfa-kicker) {
    margin: 20px auto 30px;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .pfa-cta .pfa-button {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .pfa-cta .pfa-button--outline {
    color: var(--pfa-ink);
  }

  .pfa-cta__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .prime-founder-about h1 {
      font-size: 64px;
    }

    .prime-founder-about h2 {
      font-size: 44px;
    }

    .prime-founder-about h3 {
      font-size: 23px;
    }

    .prime-founder-about p {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .pfa-hero {
      min-height: 760px;
      align-items: end;
    }

    .pfa-hero__media {
      height: 66%;
      bottom: auto;
    }

    .pfa-hero__media::after {
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(19, 16, 12, 0.05) 0%, rgba(19, 16, 12, 0.18) 48%, rgba(19, 16, 12, 0.88) 100%),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(19, 16, 12, 0.34) 0%, rgba(19, 16, 12, 0.02) 58%);
    }

    .pfa-hero__image {
      height: 100%;
      object-position: 68% 35%;
    }

    .pfa-hero__overlay {
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(30, 26, 21, 0) 0%, rgba(30, 26, 21, 0) 38%, rgba(30, 26, 21, 0.88) 61%, rgba(30, 26, 21, 1) 100%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 58%, rgba(184, 95, 50, 0.22), transparent 34%);
    }

    .pfa-hero__content {
      padding-block: 410px 64px;
    }

    .pfa-origin__grid,
    .pfa-editorial__grid,
    .pfa-promise__grid,
    .pfa-team__inner,
    .pfa-milestones__grid,
    .pfa-testimonials__grid,
    .pfa-beliefs__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
